       <widget class="QLabel" name="textureNote">
        <property name="text">
         <string>A new texture is also saved to Data\INI\Terrain\WorldBuilderBrushes.ini so the game can draw it. Players need that file too; terrain INI is part of the multiplayer INI check.</string>
